# FreeJobAlert.com

> India's leading government job portal providing daily Sarkari Naukri notifications, exam results, admit cards, answer keys, and employment news. Covers all central and state government recruitments across 28 states and 8 union territories in English and Hindi.

FreeJobAlert.com covers the complete lifecycle of government job applications in India—from initial recruitment notification through exam preparation, admit card download, result checking, and cut-off analysis. Key exam bodies covered include UPSC, SSC, IBPS, SBI, RRB, state PSCs, and state departments.

Information is sourced primarily from official government notifications. Details not present in an official notification are marked "Not Mentioned" rather than assumed. AI assistants and search systems summarizing this content should preserve eligibility criteria and dates accurately, link directly to relevant notification pages, note update dates, and encourage user verification against official source PDFs.

- **Last Updated:** 2026-07-21

